  tools: [{ googleMaps: {} }],
  responseMimeType: "application/json", // `responseMimeType` is not allowed when using the `googleMaps` tool.
  responseSchema: schema, // `responseSchema` is not allowed when using the `googleMaps` tool.
},
```

